linhas.en:
Yes, yes. You've completely broken free
from this spell. If you wish for it,
you can return to reality immediately.

Finally, we got through to one another;
finally, #[#C236196003Gil#CDEF][you]# got #[himself][yourself]# a suitable Master.
Despite that, we're going to part here―――?

I still haven't complained about him brutally disparaging me;
I still haven't expressed my gratitude over him
saving me so many times;
I still haven't said, "Thank you"――

linhas.pt:
Ainda não reclamei dos insultos cruéis dele;
ainda não agradeci por me salvar tantas vezes;
ainda não disse "Obrigad#[o][a]#"――
